      hu: ["A Niavaran-palota 1958 és 1968 között épült.", "Az Ahmad Shahi-pavilon az utolsó Kadsar sah nyári rezidenciája volt.", "A főépület elektromosan nyitható tetővel rendelkezik.", "A Sahebgharanieh-palota Nassereddin sah rezidenciája volt.", "A könyvtárban több mint 23 000 történelmi könyv található.", "A komplexum parkja 110 000 négyzetméteren terül el."],
      ro: ["Palatul Niavaran a fost construit între anii 1958 și 1968.", "Pavilionul Ahmad Shahi a fost reședința de vară a ultimului șah Qajar.", "Clădirea principală are un acoperiș care se poate deschide electric.", "Palatul Sahebgharanieh a fost reședința lui Shah Nassereddin.", "Biblioteca găzduiește peste 23.000 de cărți istorice.", "Parcul complexului se întinde pe o suprafață de 110.000 mp."],
      en: ["The Niavaran Palace was built between 1958 and 1968.", "The Ahmad Shahi Pavilion was the summer residence of the last Qajar Shah.", "The main building features a roof that can be opened electrically.", "Sahebgharanieh Palace was the residence of Shah Nassereddin.", "The library contains over 23,000 historical books.", "The park of the complex covers 110,000 square meters."],
