      en: ["The complex comprises a total of 18 different palaces.", "The Green Palace was built from rare stone from the Zanjan region.", "The White Palace features 54 rooms and halls.", "The grounds were originally owned by the Qajar dynasty.", "The complex now houses the Museum of Anthropology.", "An artificial river flows through the extensive park grounds."],
